{"seq":2,"slug":"triangulation","title":"多边形三角剖分：把复杂形状拆成三角形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/convex-triangulation/triangulation","wordCount":1925,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多边形三角剖分-把复杂形状拆成三角形\">多边形三角剖分：把复杂形状拆成三角形</h1><p>三角形是平面上最简单、最好处理的多边形——它必然是凸的、面积用一个叉积就能算、点是否落在里面用三次转向测试就能判。于是一个反复出现的策略是：拿到一个任意复杂的多边形（凹的、带洞的），先把它切成互不重叠的三角形，再对每个三角形做简单处理。这就是三角剖分，它是有限元网格、可见性分析、点定位、地形建模的共同底层。本节讲如何把多边形正确、高效地剖开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个简单多边形（边不自交）的三角剖分，是用互不相交的对角线把它的内部划分成若干三角形，且这些对角线只在顶点处相接。一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个顶点的简单多边形，其任意三角剖分都恰好包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个三角形和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 条对角线——这个不变量与剖分方式无关，是三角剖分理论的基石。</p>\n<p>存在性由「两耳定理」保证：任何顶点数至少为 4 的简单多边形，至少存在两个「耳朵」。所谓耳朵，是指一个顶点，它与两个相邻顶点构成的三角形完全落在多边形内部、且不含其他顶点。这个定理不仅保证剖分总能完成，还直接给出一个朴素算法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[简单多边形] --&gt; B{是否单调/凸?}&#10;  B --&gt;|凸| C[扇形剖分 O n]&#10;  B --&gt;|单调| D[栈式扫描 O n]&#10;  B --&gt;|一般简单多边形| E[耳切法 O n^2]&#10;  A --&gt; F[先分解为单调块&lt;br/&gt;梯形化 O n log n]&#10;  F --&gt; D&#10;  E --&gt; G[n-2 个三角形]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[简单多边形] --&gt; B{是否单调/凸?}\n  B --&gt;|凸| C[扇形剖分 O n]\n  B --&gt;|单调| D[栈式扫描 O n]\n  B --&gt;|一般简单多边形| E[耳切法 O n^2]\n  A --&gt; F[先分解为单调块&lt;br/&gt;梯形化 O n log n]\n  F --&gt; D\n  E --&gt; G[n-2 个三角形]\n  C --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G</pre><p>下表对比几种三角剖分策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用多边形</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扇形剖分</td>\n<td>凸多边形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>从一个顶点向所有非邻点连对角线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耳切法</td>\n<td>任意简单多边形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>实现简单，工程常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单调多边形扫描</td>\n<td>y-单调多边形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用栈逐行处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯形化+单调分解</td>\n<td>任意简单多边形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>de Berg 教材标准法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chazelle 算法</td>\n<td>任意简单多边形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>理论最优，极其复杂，实践不用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"耳切法-最直观的实现\">耳切法：最直观的实现</h2><p>耳切法（ear clipping）直接把两耳定理变成算法：扫描多边形顶点，找到一个「耳尖」（凸顶点，且它构成的三角形内不含任何其他顶点），把这个三角形切下来记录，然后从多边形中删掉该耳尖顶点，剩下的多边形顶点数减一，重复直到只剩三角形。判断一个顶点是不是耳尖，要做两件事：用转向测试确认它是凸顶点（对逆时针多边形，相邻三点左转），再检查其余顶点是否落在这个候选三角形内（点在三角形内可由三次转向测试判定），二者都用到上一章的谓词，见 <a href=\"../foundations/geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>。</p>\n<p>朴素耳切每轮扫描找耳、每次检查内部点，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。它的优点是实现极短、易于加入「洞」的处理（把洞多边形通过一条桥接对角线并入外多边形），因此是游戏引擎、三角化库最常用的方法。切耳前通常要先用鞋带公式统一顶点绕向，保证凸凹判断的方向一致，见 <a href=\"../foundations/geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单调多边形与扫描线分解\">单调多边形与扫描线分解</h2><p>要突破 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，经典路线是「先分解成单调多边形，再线性剖分单调块」。一个多边形若被一条水平线扫过时，其边界与扫描线的交点数在整个扫描过程中的变化受控（每条链上的顶点 y 坐标单调），就称为 y-单调。单调多边形有个好性质：可以用一个栈从上到下贪心地一次扫描就完成三角剖分，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>把任意简单多边形分解为单调块，用的是扫描线范式：一条水平线从上往下扫过所有顶点，在每个顶点处根据它是「起始、结束、分裂、合并、普通」哪种类型，维护当前活跃的边并在必要时加入对角线消除「分裂顶点」和「合并顶点」——正是这两类顶点破坏了单调性。这一步是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（排序顶点 + 每个事件在平衡树里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。扫描线是计算几何的通用武器，它在线段相交里以完整形态出现，见 <a href=\"../queries/line-intersection\">线段相交</a>。分解后每个单调块 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 剖分，总复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是 de Berg 教材的标准做法。Chazelle 1991 年证明了理论上存在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的算法，但它复杂到几乎无人实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"美术馆定理-三角剖分的一个漂亮推论\">美术馆定理：三角剖分的一个漂亮推论</h2><p>三角剖分不只是工程手段，它还能证明优美的组合结果。美术馆问题问：一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 面墙的多边形展厅，最少需要多少个固定位置的警卫，才能保证每个角落都被至少一个警卫看到（警卫视线可 360 度但被墙挡住）？答案是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor n/3 \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 个，且存在需要这么多的最坏形状（梳齿形多边形）。</p>\n<p>Fisk 1978 年给出了一个仅用三角剖分的极简证明：先把多边形三角剖分，再把剖分后的顶点用三种颜色染色，使每个三角形的三个顶点颜色两两不同（三角剖分的对偶图是树，因此三染色总能做到）；三种颜色里数量最少的那一色至多有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor n/3\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 个顶点，把警卫放在这一色的所有顶点上，由于每个三角形都含这一色的一个顶点，整个展厅被覆盖。这个证明是「构造一个几何结构，再在其上做组合论证」的典范，也说明三角剖分为何是许多算法的第一步。可见性与守卫问题在机器人、游戏 AI 里有直接应用，见 <a href=\"../practice/geometry-in-graphics\">图形与碰撞中的应用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从多边形到点集-delaunay-的引子\">从多边形到点集：Delaunay 的引子</h2><p>本节讨论的是给定多边形边界的三角剖分。另一个相关但不同的问题是：给定一堆散点（没有预先指定的边界），把它们连成一个「好」的三角网，覆盖它们的凸包。这类点集三角剖分有无穷多种，其中 Delaunay 三角剖分因「最大化最小角、避免瘦长三角形」而被公认为质量最优，它是网格生成与插值的首选，将在下一节专门展开，见 <a href=\"delaunay-voronoi\">Delaunay 与 Voronoi</a>。区分「多边形三角剖分」（有边界约束）与「点集三角剖分」（无约束、追求质量）是理解这两节分工的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>简单多边形的三角剖分把内部划成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个三角形、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 条对角线，这个数量是不变量；存在性由两耳定理保证。</li>\n<li>耳切法直接实现两耳定理，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，实现简单、易处理带洞多边形，是工程与游戏引擎常用法。</li>\n<li>突破平方级用「扫描线分解为单调多边形（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）+ 单调块栈式剖分（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）」，扫描线是通用范式。</li>\n<li>美术馆定理（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor n/3\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 警卫）用三角剖分加三染色优雅证明，展示三角剖分作为论证工具的力量。</li>\n<li>本节是「有边界约束」的多边形剖分，与下节「无约束、追求质量」的点集 Delaunay 剖分相区别。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>判凸/点在三角形内的谓词：<a href=\"../foundations/geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>。</li>\n<li>质量最优的点集三角剖分：<a href=\"delaunay-voronoi\">Delaunay 与 Voronoi</a>。</li>\n<li>单调分解所用的扫描线范式全貌：<a href=\"../queries/line-intersection\">线段相交</a>。</li>\n<li>三角网在渲染里的角色：<a href=\"../../../cs-fundamentals/computer-graphics/geometry/mesh-representation\">计算机图形学·网格表示</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多边形三角剖分：把复杂形状拆成三角形","id":"多边形三角剖分-把复杂形状拆成三角形"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"耳切法：最直观的实现","id":"耳切法-最直观的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"单调多边形与扫描线分解","id":"单调多边形与扫描线分解"},{"level":2,"text":"美术馆定理：三角剖分的一个漂亮推论","id":"美术馆定理-三角剖分的一个漂亮推论"},{"level":2,"text":"从多边形到点集：Delaunay 的引子","id":"从多边形到点集-delaunay-的引子"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"凸包算法：把橡皮筋套在钉子上","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/convex-triangulation/convex-hull"},"next":{"title":"Delaunay 与 Voronoi：一枚硬币的两面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/convex-triangulation/delaunay-voronoi"}}